; The browser build: the same entry point compiled two ways.
;
;   main.bc.js        js_of_ocaml, one file, loads synchronously
;   main.bc.wasm.js   wasm_of_ocaml, a loader beside a .wasm in main.bc.wasm.assets
;
; The Rust and Haskell pair reached the browser as TWO wasm modules with
; separate linear memories and a JavaScript trampoline copying bytes between
; them. One implementation needs neither.
(executable
 (name main)
 (enabled_if false)
 (modes js wasm)
 (libraries hypergraph js_of_ocaml)
 (preprocess (pps js_of_ocaml-ppx)))
